HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra1011.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra1012.fits,spectra1013.fits, spectra1014.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1015.fits,spectra1016.fits, spectra1017.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1018.fits,spectra1019.fits, spectra1020.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1021.fits,spectra1022.fits, spectra1023.fits,                    HISTORY spectra1024.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 0.9420360770949413, 0.9284110312792092,0.951517985012731,               HISTORY 0.9122157941056576, 0.9944298291392227,1.0056329235540609,              HISTORY 1.0279487547860093, 1.0486500981176317,0.9669013104147829,              HISTORY 0.968796680950342, 1.0322045647507074,1.0931565010362356,               HISTORY 1.1175580058724284, 1.0705659750659033.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             